{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bog_iron_patch","model_identifier":"bog_iron_patch","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bog_iron_patch\n\nBog iron patch: a reddish, oily bog puddle with rust-coloured lumps, about 2 m across.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -34..34, y 0..20, z -26..26 units (1.91 x 0.56 x 1.46 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 27.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 68 x 20 x 52 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): bog iron to dig\n- `depleted`: the puddle with one small lump left\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck |\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"mud_full","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34.0,0.0,-26.0],"to":[34.0,0.6,26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[34.0,66.4,102.0,67.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,69.4,52.0,70.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[34.0,66.4,102.0,67.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,69.4,52.0,70.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,68.0,52.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,68.0,52.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3c0cddad-3049-5065-94ca-79afc1553393"},{"name":"pool_full","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-26.0,0.6,-18.0],"to":[24.0,1.0,18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":